{"parentUuid":"06a8ba32-df57-4270-a72e-d42d120d7ebb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01LBPGNrTPRn8Ahkni8ELY59","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The `PendingReviewMarker` — a small JSON file at `.git/entire-sessions/review-pending.json`.\n\nStruct definition (`cmd/entire/cli/review.go:46-52`):\n\n```go\ntype PendingReviewMarker struct {\n    AgentName    string    `json:\"agent_name\"`     // e.g. \"claude-code\"\n    Skills       []string  `json:\"skills\"`         // selected skills\n    StartingSHA  string    `json:\"starting_sha\"`   // HEAD SHA at review time\n    StartedAt    time.Time `json:\"started_at\"`     // UTC timestamp\n    WorktreePath string    `json:\"worktree_path,omitempty\"` // absolute worktree root\n}\n```\n\nExample contents after `entire review --track-only` in a configured repo:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"agent_name\": \"claude-code\",\n  \"skills\": [\n    \"/pr-review-toolkit:review-pr\",\n    \"/test-auditor\"\n  ],\n  \"starting_sha\": \"9411f0c48abc123...\",\n  \"started_at\": \"2026-04-22T11:30:00Z\",\n  \"worktree_path\": \"/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli\"\n}\n```\n\nIt's the same marker written whether you use `--track-only`, the default spawn path, or the non-launchable-agent fallback — the only difference is who clears it. In the spawn path, the cleanup defer clears it if the agent exits before firing `UserPromptSubmit`; in `--track-only` and the launcher fallback, the defer isn't registered, so the marker persists until whichever agent session's `UserPromptSubmit` hook adopts it first.\n\nTwo things to note:\n\n- It lives under `.git/entire-sessions/` (shared across worktrees), *not* under `.entire/`. That's why `WorktreePath` is on the struct: multiple worktrees share the same marker directory, so an agent session in worktree B must not claim a marker written by `entire review` in worktree A. The adoption check at `review.go:173-178` skips the marker if the worktree paths don't match.\n- Only one marker exists at a time. A second `entire review` overwrites the first."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2231,"cache_read_input_tokens":206720,"output_tokens":852,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2231,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":852,"cache_read_input_tokens":206720,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2231,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2231},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaJcvv6Ew6fWmHziXN9WX","type":"assistant","uuid":"af40514e-04a9-41ac-8e2b-bb1578072e00","timestamp":"2026-04-22T10:04:38.510Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli","sessionId":"9a29d9ba-5e22-4e92-a5d0-017356e28328","version":"2.1.117","gitBranch":"feat/entire-review"}
