{"parentUuid":"2bcdc289-c1c6-4245-9b6b-ebf7496863a8","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"552ff710-8bf5-4c4b-83dd-d1c6c2e45e39","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"❯ go run cmd/entire/main.go review\nConfiguring review skills for 2 agent(s): Claude Code, Codex\n(Previously-saved skills are pre-checked. Space to toggle, enter to confirm.)\n\n┃ [1/2] Review skills for Claude Code\n┃ Agent: Claude Code\n┃   [ ] /pr-review-toolkit:review-pr — Full PR review\n┃   [ ] /pr-review-toolkit:code-reviewer — Code review for standards\n┃ > [ ] /test-auditor — Test coverage audit\n┃   [ ] /verification-before-completion — Verify before marking done\n┃   [ ] /requesting-code-review — Prepare code for review\n┃   [ ] /pr-review-toolkit:silent-failure-hunter — Find suppressed errors\n\nx toggle • ↑ up • ↓ down • / filter • enter submit • ctrl+a select all\n\nwhile this looks good, I did not understand this is a initial setup thing\n\nAnd the other thing: is there a way to query skills?"},"uuid":"6166f583-edd4-41f5-beae-28d7df5dc96e","timestamp":"2026-04-22T14:26:57.492Z","permissionMode":"acceptEdits","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli","sessionId":"9a29d9ba-5e22-4e92-a5d0-017356e28328","version":"2.1.117","gitBranch":"feat/entire-review"}
