{"parentUuid":"4ffeac28-d0dd-4a49-98dc-781454944440","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"Hardening `entire review` and fixing a `review attach` overwrite bug on branch feat/entire-review; the two fixes (metadata refresh + conflict guard) landed in the squashed commit. Next: decide what to tackle next, or verify against a pulled co-worker branch if you want to confirm the fix end-to-end. (disable recaps in /config)","timestamp":"2026-04-23T11:16:45.030Z","uuid":"f5561c63-e337-460b-9cb0-c08f2bda1277","isMeta":false,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli","sessionId":"9a29d9ba-5e22-4e92-a5d0-017356e28328","version":"2.1.117","gitBranch":"feat/entire-review"}
{"parentUuid":"f5561c63-e337-460b-9cb0-c08f2bda1277","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"40f1942f-1810-43f4-befb-d9317aaac390","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Found 2 issues:\n\n1. **`entire review` never discovers external agents before using the registry**  \n   `newReviewCmdWithDeps` calls `runReview` directly (`cmd/entire/cli/review.go:463-469`), and `runReview` immediately relies on `GetAgentsWithHooksInstalled` / `agent.Get` (`review.go:541-608`, `config.go:86-97`). Unlike `review attach`, this path never calls `external.DiscoverAndRegister(...)` (`review.go:507-513`). As a result, a review config that targets an external agent can’t be used: the agent won’t be present in the registry, won’t appear as “hooks installed”, and `entire review` will fail even though `entire attach`/hook paths work. This breaks the documented manual-settings/external-agent review flow.\n\n2. **The review picker says saved skills are pre-checked, but it never actually preselects them**  \n   `runReviewConfigPicker` advertises “Previously-saved skills are pre-checked” (`cmd/entire/cli/review.go:307-327`), but the implementation only restores `Prompt` (`review.go:353-359`). `builtinPicks` / `discoveredPicks` start empty, and `buildReviewPickerFields` creates every `huh.Option` without `.Selected(true)` (`review.go:1120-1144`). So opening `entire review --edit` on an existing config and accepting defaults will clear that agent’s saved skills instead of preserving them. That’s a destructive regression in the edit flow."},"uuid":"6cf41246-660e-4e26-814f-56a304e2124b","timestamp":"2026-04-23T11:47:10.268Z","permissionMode":"acceptEdits","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli","sessionId":"9a29d9ba-5e22-4e92-a5d0-017356e28328","version":"2.1.117","gitBranch":"feat/entire-review"}
